{
  "_note": [
    "Shared slug fixture (HANDOFF §9.3). Run by BOTH sides:",
    "  - cargo test (src/headings.rs) — the Rust HeadingParser for the Navigator",
    "  - node tests/slugs.test.js — the SHIPPED web/js/page.js pipeline (vendored markdown-it in a vm)",
    "The two must produce identical ids or sidebar clicks resolve to anchors that don't exist.",
    "skipTexts: the Rust parser keeps raw inline-HTML in display text where the DOM's textContent",
    "would not; ids still must match. Setext (underline) headings are a known, deliberate gap in",
    "the Rust parser — do not add them here."
